----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE — what shipped (parity with the web source)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  The web `WidgetTipCards` is a PURE presentational widget primitive (a shared widget building block): it
  takes `tips: TipItem[]` + optional `maxTips` / `compact` / `emptyMessage` / `emptyIcon` and renders a
  scrollable list of tip cards, each = an optional leading glyph + a title row (the medium title with an
  optional trailing impact `<Badge>`) over a muted description. It caps the list at
  `maxTips ?? (compact ? 1 : 3)` (web `tips.slice(0, limit)`), clamps the description to two lines when
  `compact` (web `compact && line-clamp-2`), and falls back to `<EmptyState>` when `visible.length === 0`.
  There is NO fetch / React-Query / Promise in the source, so it has NO loading/error/stale/offline branch
  (the host widget that owns the query renders those). Per the sibling presentational-primitive precedent
  (WidgetComparisonCard 0003, Delta 0081, MetricCard 0095, Accordion 0203) this surface reproduces ONLY the
  source's REAL branches:
    • populated list  (one card per visible tip; optional glyph + title + optional impact badge + description)
    • compact slice   (one tip, description clamped to two lines; web maxTips ?? (compact ? 1 : 3) + line-clamp-2)
    • empty leaf       (friendly "never a blank box" peer of web <EmptyState> — default "No recommendations")
  The impact badge REUSES the shared native `TSBadge` (web `Badge`) with the web `impactBadgeMap` tone
  (high -> success, medium -> warning, low -> neutral). The empty leaf REUSES the shared native `TSEmptyState`
  (web `EmptyState` from `@/components/feedback`).
  Files: WidgetTipCards.Adapter/Model/.swift/Views/Previews/Tests/AdapterTests.swift + .strings.
  Bindings : P1/S8 WidgetTipCardsModel @Observable holder (props + projection; no HTTP in the view);
             P1/S9 tokens (Color.TS/Font.TS/TSSpacing/TSRadius) — no Tailwind ports, no raw hex;
             P1/S10 NSLocalizedString facade (table "WidgetTipCards"); P1/S11 view.opened telemetry
             (slug "WidgetTipCards", emitted once + idempotent across appear/disappear).
  i18n     : web source has 0 t() keys (anonymous; its only literal "No recommendations" is reproduced via
             widgetTipCards.empty). The web `tip.impact` raw-enum fallback (shown when no impactLabel is
             given) is localized via widgetTipCards.impact.{high,medium,low} so no raw English ships. Native
             a11y/HIG additions: emptyHint, cardLabel, cardLabelWithImpact. 0 dead keys.
  a11y     : each card folds into one VoiceOver element reading "{title}, {impact}. {description}" (impact
             omitted when absent); the leading glyph is decorative + hidden; min card height 44pt (web
             min-h-[44px]); Dynamic Type via tokens; populated list is an accessibility container.

